    "_enabled": true,
    "__prefab": {
      "__id__": 355
    },
    "_lineHeight": 120,
    "_string": "6 or more scattered <img src = '11' height=50 offset=35/> during the base game will award the sum of the values displayed on <img src = '11' height=50 offset=35/> and the Feature Selection.\nIf at least 1 position does not contain <img src = '11' height=50 offset=35/>, then the Feature Selection offers the choice of the Free Games Bonus or the Top Up Bonus.\n<img src = '11' height=50 offset=35/> and <img src = '10' height=50 offset=35/> do not appear during the Free Games Bonus.",
